- **Per-step `try/catch`, not one big one.** A single wrapping `try/catch` would relabel every error with the last prefix. Each step catches only its own await so the prefixes (`Failed to read input:`, `Failed to parse data:`, `Validation failed:`, `Transform failed:`, `Failed to write output:`) stay attached to the right operation.
